[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/23db53380c461b7f978c620d5607f9b23271e10c.png]]((Make Your Move. announcement art))

Solomon remains calm and collected when facing a new challenger, so when the Patrons come calling, he approaches the city as if it's one giant chessboard. With __Setup Bishop__ he advances, planting his loyal damage dealers ahead of him and sliding them across the streets with ease. __Kingside Knight__ comes into play when it's time for defense, granting protection to allies and making tactical retreats when needed. __Rook Battery__ charges forward with great force, stalling enemies in their tracks. And with his final move, __Develop Queen__, he locks down his enemies in an ultimate checkmate. - __"There's a lot you can learn from losing to a master."__

Solomon is available in-game now (__just__ in time for National Chess Day)! We're halfway through our latest set of heroes, keep your votes coming to help determine who will be joining us next **Tuesday at 2pm PDT.** Have a great weekend!